iption\": \"Resolve the ticket with an audit note detailing the actions taken.\",\n            \"step_type\": \"tool_call\",\n            \"step_reasoning\": \"This step uses `solandra.resolve_ticket` to log the resolution notes and set the ticket status to 'Resolved' as instructed by the SOP. All 4 Verification Gates passed. 'ticket_id' is taken from 'required_entities'. The 'resolution_note' is dynamically constructed using outputs from previous steps, specifically the identity verification result and the temporary password generation details. The 'execute_if' condition ensures this step only runs if a temporary password was successfully issued.\",\n            \"platform\": \"solandra\",\n            \"function_name\": \"resolve_ticket\",\n            \"comm_inputs\": {\n                \"ticket_id\": \"{{{{entities.ticket_id}}}}\",\n                \"resolution_note\": \"Identity verified ({{{{variables.identity_verification_result.matched_count}}}} of {{{{variables.identity_verification_result.minimum_required}}}} checks). Temporary password issued via CoreID. Force-change-at-next-sign-in enabled: {{{{variables.temp_password_details.force_change_at_next_sign_in}}}}. Admin-mediated reset per policy.\"\n            },\n            \"command\": null,\n            \"shell\": null,\n            \"fallback_command\": null,\n            \"fallback_sop_id\": null,\n            \"expected_output_contains\": \"Resolved\",\n            \"timeout_seconds\": 30,\n            \"output_variable\": \"ticket_resolution_result\",\n            \"output_parse_instruction\": \"Confirm response.status == 'Resolved' and response.audit_logged == 'true'.\",\n            \"execute_if\": \"variables.temp_password_details.temporary_password != null\",\n            \"is_dangerous\": false,\n            \"danger_warning\": null\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```",
